# Harvest Flow

See [08-execution-flows.md](../08-execution-flows.md).

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Keeper
    participant S as StrategyBase
    participant IF as Index Finance
    participant RR as RewardRegistry
    participant ER as ExecutionRouter
    participant V as RobinVault

    Keeper->>S: harvest()
    S->>IF: claimRewards
    loop each reward token
        S->>S: try processRewardToken
        S->>RR: getRewardTokenConfig
        alt Sell
            S->>ER: swapExactInput
        else Retain Growth only
            S->>S: _retainRewardAmount
        end
    end
    S->>S: totalAssets delta → HarvestReport
    S->>V: transfer debtPayment INDEX
    S->>V: report(HarvestReport)
    V->>V: update debt, lockedProfit, fees
```
